{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uberkill!</strong> Uncompromising action with no room for error.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One shot \u2013 one kill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a declaration of love for Hotline Miami.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646040/extras/ezgif-4014eadedd160b.gif?t=1755802707\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game we missed ourselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The action takes place in a secret lair of evil on the dark side of the Moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are alone \u2013 against mad scientists, deadly soldiers and mythical experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies will always be fast, accurate and ruthless. Don\u2019t miss \u2013 they don\u2019t forgive mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use an impressive arsenal of firearms and melee weapons, painting the corridors red.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646040/extras/IMG_13246.png?t=1755802707\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the environment to colorfully deal with opponents. Brutal cruelty, liters of pixel blood, tons of weapons and chilling space behind the thin walls of the lunar modules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go through Hangars, Laboratories and Dungeons, leaving no one alive. They deserve it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 15 levels where you will experience pain, rage and agony!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yours or your enemies - it's up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock all the variety of additional abilities: improvements for the hero, giving advantages and changing the style of passing levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment can be broken, and the villains can (and should!) be finished off - spectacularly, lusciously and cruelly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase your result of stylish and continuous murders under the author's rhythmic soundtrack (dark trance, synth wave, heavy metal).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rush to the rhythm of the dance of chaos and death through the entire game and turn around to the work of your own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a challenge. A tough nut to crack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the end of the story and blow everything up - from top to bottom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3646040?t=1755802707","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646040/a55a6fecd8decd6d843feaffeadde7f6fba5b242/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755802707","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646040/c7f1cb5ab5956753740b1ce3bf21619799120deb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755802707","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646040/c7f1cb5ab5956753740b1ce3bf21619799120deb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755802707","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uberkill!</strong> Uncompromising action with no room for error.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One shot \u2013 one kill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a declaration of love for Hotline Miami.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646040/extras/ezgif-4014eadedd160b.gif?t=1755802707\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game we missed ourselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The action takes place in a secret lair of evil on the dark side of the Moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are alone \u2013 against mad scientists, deadly soldiers and mythical experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies will always be fast, accurate and ruthless. Don\u2019t miss \u2013 they don\u2019t forgive mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use an impressive arsenal of firearms and melee weapons, painting the corridors red.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646040/extras/IMG_13246.png?t=1755802707\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the environment to colorfully deal with opponents. Brutal cruelty, liters of pixel blood, tons of weapons and chilling space behind the thin walls of the lunar modules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go through Hangars, Laboratories and Dungeons, leaving no one alive. They deserve it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 15 levels where you will experience pain, rage and agony!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yours or your enemies - it's up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock all the variety of additional abilities: improvements for the hero, giving advantages and changing the style of passing levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment can be broken, and the villains can (and should!) be finished off - spectacularly, lusciously and cruelly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase your result of stylish and continuous murders under the author's rhythmic soundtrack (dark trance, synth wave, heavy metal).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rush to the rhythm of the dance of chaos and death through the entire game and turn around to the work of your own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a challenge. A tough nut to crack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the end of the story and blow everything up - from top to bottom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Crack Head Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":